        <endpoint>x_58872_needit_needit_api_documentation.do</endpoint>
        <html><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>
GET ni_getinfo: Get aggregate NeedIt information for records for a specific user from the NeedIt table.
</li>

<li>
Response includes total number of NeedIt records, count per request type, and user information.
</li>

<li>
GET ni_getinfo(v2): Has all the same features as v1 but also includes a custom error message if the request passes an invalid user name.
</li>
</ul>]]></html>
